    <h1 class="cs-title">Understanding complex workflows at scale</h1>
    <p class="cs-subtitle">
      A 12-week ethnographic study mapping how operations teams coordinate cross-functional work — and why their existing tools were failing them silently.
    </p>
    <div class="cs-meta">
      <div class="cs-meta-item">
        <div class="cs-meta-label">Role</div>
